<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean, products basis levels. (NS-no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount NB-no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> July		10/20 D	July	    23/20 D</p>
<p> August	    30/40 P	August	  27/35 P</p>
<p> Sept	    100/110 P	Sept	   90/110 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> July		30/25 D	July	    32/30 D</p>
<p> August		8/5 D	August	   10/8 D</p>
<p> Sept		 5/12 P	Sept		5/9 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> July		45/50 P	 July	   45/60 P</p>
<p> August	    50/55 P	 August	 50/60 P</p>
<p> Sept		40/45 P	 Sept	   40/50 P</p>
